        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Internationale Poster</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #1a1a1a;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px 0;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    width: 1076px;\n    min-height: 1554px;\n    background: #f0d049;\n    border: 6px solid #1a1a1a;\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 12px;\n  }\n  .poster-inner {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 1530px;\n  }\n  .left-column {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 460px;\n    height: 100%;\n  }\n  .photo-block {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 460px;\n    border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .photo-placeholder {\n    background: #6b4a35;\n    color: #f0d049;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .caption {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 4px;\n    left: 6px;\n    color: #f0d049;\n    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px #000;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  .red-panel {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 470px;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    background: #b81f24;\n    clip-path: polygon(15% 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%, 0% 100%, 5% 65%);\n  }\n  .bottom-crowd {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    height: 400px;\n    background: #6b4a35;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #f0d049;\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    border-top: 2px solid #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .bottom-caption {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    left: 12px;\n    color: #f0d049;\n    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    z-index: 3;\n  }\n  .flag-figure {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 260px;\n    left: 480px;\n    width: 260px;\n    height: 220px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #f0d049;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-family: Georgia, serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    text-align: center;\n    z-index: 3;\n  }\n  .title {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 130px;\n    left: 545px;\n    right: 60px;\n    color: #f0d049;\n    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 46px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .poem {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 225px;\n    left: 545px;\n    right: 45px;\n    color: #f0d049;\n    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    white-space: pre-wrap;\n  }\n  .refrain {\n    margin-left: 60px;\n  }\n  .stanza {\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n  <div class=\"poster-inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"left-column\">\n      <div class=\"photo-block\" style=\"height:300px;\">\n        <div class=\"photo-placeholder\" style=\"height:100%;\">[Photo: crowd with rifles on vehicle, sepia-duotone]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">1871 Paris Commune</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-block\" style=\"height:280px;\">\n        <div class=\"photo-placeholder\" style=\"height:100%;\">[Photo: crowd with banners/flags]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">1889 London Dockers Strike</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-block\" style=\"height:280px;\">\n        <div class=\"photo-placeholder\" style=\"height:100%;\">[Photo: uniformed men marching in rows]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">1916 Irish Citizens Army</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"photo-block\" style=\"height:260px;\">\n        <div class=\"photo-placeholder\" style=\"height:100%;\">[Photo: armored vehicle with soldiers]</div>\n        <div class=\"caption\">1917 the Red Army, USSR</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"red-panel\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"title\">INTERNATIONALE</div>\n\n    <div class=\"poem\">\n<div class=\"stanza\">arise you prisoners of starvation\narise you wretched of the earth.\nfor justice thunders condemnation,\na better worlds in birth.\nno more traditions chains shall bind us\narise you slaves,no more in thrall\nthe earth shall rise on new foundations\nwe have been naught,we shall,be all.</div>\n<div class=\"refrain\">tis the final conflict,\nlet each stand in his place\nthe internationale\nshall be the human race.</div>\n</div>\n\n    <div class=\"poem\" style=\"top:552px;\">\n<div class=\"stanza\">we want no condesending saviours\nto rule us from their judgement hall\nwe workers ask not for their favours\nlet us consult for all.\nto make the theif disgorge his booty\nto free the spirit from its cell\nwe must ourselves decide our duty\ndecide and do it well.</div>\n<div class=\"refrain\">tis the final conflict......</div>\n</div>\n\n    <div class=\"poem\" style=\"top:745px;\">\n<div class=\"stanza\">toilers from shop and field united\nthe union of all who work,\nthe earth belongs to us as workers\nno room for those who shirk.\nhow many on our flesh have fattened\nbut if the bloody birds of prey\nshall vanish from the sky one morning\nthe golden sun will stay.</div>\n<div class=\"refrain\">tis the final conflict......</div>\n</div>\n\n    <div class=\"flag-figure\">[Illustration: red flag and two silhouetted figures standing on a hill]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-crowd\">[Photo: dense crowd of people, duotone red/yellow, viewed from behind]</div>\n    <div class=\"bottom-caption\">1919 the Red Clyde, Glasgow</div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
